

**BASSET - FUNCTIONS**



**10.2. Modified Spherical Bessel Functions Definitions Differential Equation 0.2.1**

\({}^{2}\)_w' + 2zw' --[ z\({}^{2}\)+n(n\)+1)]w=0_

(_n_=0, \(\pm 1\), \(\pm 2\), ... .)

Particular solutions are the _Modified Spherical Bessel functions of the first kind,_

\[\overline{{}_{2}\pi/z}I_{n+{\frac{1}{2}}}(z) = e^{-n\pi t/2}j_{n}(ze^{\pi i/2})\qquad(-\pi{<}{\rm arg}\ z{\leq} \frac{1}{2}\pi)\] \[= e^{3n\pi i/2}j_{n}(ze^{-3\pi t/2})\qquad(\frac{1}{2}\pi{<}{\rm arg }\ z{\leq}\pi)\]

_f the second kind,_

0.2.3

\[\overline{{}_{2}\pi/z}I_{-n-{\frac{1}{2}}}(z) = e^{3(n+1)\pi t/2}y_{n}(ze^{\pi t/2})\] \[(-\pi{<}{\rm arg}\ z{\leq}\frac{1}{2}\pi)\] \[= e^{-(n+1)\pi t/2}y_{n}(ze^{-3\pi t/2})\] \[(\frac{1}{2}\pi{<}{\rm arg}\ z{\leq}\pi)\]

_f the third kind,_

0.2.4

\[\overline{{}_{2}\pi/z}K_{n+{\frac{1}{2}}}(z){=}\frac{1}{2}\pi(-1)^{n+1} \sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}[I_{n+{\frac{1}{2}}}(z)-I_{-n-{\frac{1}{2}}}(z)]\]

The pairs

\[\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}I_{n+{\frac{1}{2}}}(z),\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}I_{-n-{ \frac{1}{2}}}(z)\]

nd

\[\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}I_{n+{\frac{1}{2}}}(z),\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}K_{n+{ \frac{1}{2}}}(z)\]

are linearly independent solutions for every \(n\).

Most properties of the Modified Spherical Bessel functions can be derived from those of the spherical Bessel functions by use of the above relations.

0.2.5

\[\overline{{}_{2}\pi/z}I_{n+{\frac{1}{2}}}(z){=}\frac{z^{n}}{1\cdot 3\cdot 5 \ldots\ (2n{+}1)}\]

\[\left\{1{+}\frac{\frac{1}{2}z^{2}}{1!(2n{+}3)}+\frac{(\frac{1}{2}z^{2})^{2}}{ 2!(2n{+}3)(2n{+}5)}+\ \ldots\right\}\]

0.2.6

\[\overline{{}_{2}\pi/z}I_{-n-{\frac{1}{2}}}(z){=}\frac{1\cdot 3\cdot 5 \ldots\ (2n{-}1)}{(-1)^{n}z^{n+1}}\]

\[\left\{1{+}\frac{\frac{1}{2}z^{2}}{1!(1{-}2n)}{+}\frac{(\frac{1}{2}z^{2})^{2} }{2!(1{-}2n)(3{-}2n)}{+}\ldots\right\}\]

(\(n{=}0\), \(1\), \(2\), \(\ldots\) .)



**10.2.7**

\[W\{\sqrt{\frac{3}{2}\pi/z}I_{n+\hat{1}}(z),\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}I_{-n-\hat{1}} (z)\}=(-1)^{n+1}z^{-2}\]

**10.2.8**

\[W\{\sqrt{\frac{3}{2}\pi/z}I_{n+\hat{1}}(z),\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}K_{n+\hat{1}} (z)\}=-\frac{1}{2}\pi z^{-2}\]

**Representations by Elementary Functions**

**10.2.9**

\[\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}I_{n+\hat{1}}(z)=(2z)^{-\hat{1}}[R(n+\frac{1}{2},-z)e^{z}\]

\[-(-1)^{n}R(n+\frac{1}{2},z)e^{-z}]\]

**10.2.10**

\[\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}I_{-n-\hat{1}}(z)=(2z)^{-\hat{1}}[R(n+\frac{1}{2},-z)e^{z}\]

\[+(-1)^{n}R(n+\frac{1}{2},z)e^{-\hat{1}}\]

\[R(n+\frac{1}{2},z)=1+\frac{(n+1)!}{1!\Gamma(n)}\;(2z)^{-1}\]

\[+\frac{(n+2)!}{2!\Gamma(n-1)}\;(2z)^{-2}+\ldots\cdot\]

\[=\sum_{0}^{n}\;(n+\frac{1}{2},k)(2z)^{-\hat{k}}\]

\[(n=0,1,2,\ldots)\]

**10.2.12**

\[\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}I_{n+\hat{1}}(z)=g_{n}(z)\;\sinh\,z+g_{-n-1}(z)\;\cosh\,z\]

\[g_{0}(z)=z^{-1},\,g_{1}(z)=-z^{-2}\]

\[g_{n-1}(z)-g_{n+1}(z)=(2n+1)z^{-1}g_{n}(z)\]

\[(n=0,\,\pm 1,\pm 2,\,\ldots)\]

**The Functions \(\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}I_{\pm(n+\hat{1})}(z)\), \(n=0,1,2\)**

**10.2.13**

\[\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}I_{1/2}(z)= \frac{\sinh\,z}{z}\]

\[\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}I_{3/2}(z)= -\frac{\sinh\,z}{z^{2}}+\frac{\cosh\,z}{z}\]

\[\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}I_{5/2}(z)= \left(\frac{3}{z^{2}}+\frac{1}{z}\right)\sinh\,z-\frac{3}{z^{2}}\cosh\,z\]

**10.2.14**

\[\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}I_{-1/2}(z)= \frac{\cosh\,z}{z}\]

\[\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}I_{-3/2}(z)= \frac{\sinh\,z}{z}\frac{\cosh\,z}{z^{2}}\]

\[\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}\pi/z}I_{-s/2}(z)= -\frac{3}{z^{2}}\sinh\,z+\left(\frac{3}{z^{2}}+\frac{1}{z}\right) \cosh\,z\]